    "Name": "Mulligan MAP",
    "Details": "Created to dominate the battlefield, the 160 ton Mulligan Mobile Assault Platform was designed to engage enemies at every conceivable range. An Arrow IV and a pair of LRM-10s make up the vehicles long range firepower, while 6 Medium lasers, an AC/20 and a UAC/5 provide closer range fire power. 4 Streak SRM-2s finish off any survivors. Despite its battlefield success, the Mulligan only ever saw limited production and finally died out during the chaos of the succession wars.<b><color=#ffcc00>Fusion: Expensive engine that works in a Vacuum.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 2/3 hexes / 60/90 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       335    112\n<b>Left</b>         260    112\n<b>Right</b>       260    112\n<b>Rear</b>        210    112\n<b>Turret</b>      260    112\n\n<b>Total</b>      1325    560</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>",
    "Icon": "Gulltoppr"
  },
